"Named tuples are also supported by generic function :func:`copy.replace`."
msgstr ""
"Benannte Tupel werden auch von der generischen Funktion :func:`copy.replace` "
"unterstützt."

#: ../../library/collections.rst:1002
msgid ""
"Raise :exc:`TypeError` instead of :exc:`ValueError` for invalid keyword "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
"Bei ungültigen Schlüsselwortargumenten wird :exc:`TypeError` statt "
":exc:`ValueError` ausgelöst."

#: ../../library/collections.rst:1008
msgid ""
"Tuple of strings listing the field names.  Useful for introspection and for "
"creating new named tuple types from existing named tuples."
msgstr ""
"Tupel von Strings, das die Feldnamen auflistet. Nützlich für Introspektion "
"und um aus bestehenden benannten Tupeln neue Typen benannter Tupel zu "
"erzeugen."

#: ../../library/collections.rst:1011
msgid ""
">>> p._fields            # view the field names\n"
"('x', 'y')\n"
"\n"
">>> Color = namedtuple('Color', 'red green blue')\n"
">>> Pixel = namedtuple('Pixel', Point._fields + Color._fields)\n"
">>> Pixel(11, 22, 128, 255, 0)\n"
"Pixel(x=11, y=22, red=128, green=255, blue=0)"
msgstr ""
">>> p._fields            # view the field names\n"
"('x', 'y')\n"
"\n"
">>> Color = namedtuple('Color', 'red green blue')\n"
">>> Pixel = namedtuple('Pixel', Point._fields + Color._fields)\n"
">>> Pixel(11, 22, 128, 255, 0)\n"
"Pixel(x=11, y=22, red=128, green=255, blue=0)"

#: ../../library/collections.rst:1023
